# 3. BEPUL BULUTLI MA'LUMOTLAR BAZASI (FREE CLOUD DATABASE)
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Variant A: Firebase Realtime Database (100% BEPUL, 1 daqiqada ulanadi)
# Qanday ulanadi:
# 1. https://console.firebase.google.com ga kiring va yangi loyiha oching.
# 2. "Build" -> "Realtime Database" bo'limiga o'ting va "Create Database" ni bosing.
# 3. "Rules" bo'limida '.read': true, '.write': true qilib "Publish" ni bosing.
# 4. Chiqqan URL manzilini quyiga qo'ying:
# Masalan: FIREBASE_DB_URL=https://akbaraliyev-portfolio-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com
